{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14987","headline":"早秋望华清宫中树因以成咏 · 卢纶","name":"早秋望华清宫中树因以成咏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"可怜云木藂，满禁碧蒙蒙。\n色润灵泉近，阴清辇路通。\n玉坛标八桂，金井识双桐。\n交映凝寒露，相和起夜风。\n数枝盘石上，几叶落云中。\n燕拂宜秋霁，蝉鸣觉昼空。\n翠屏更隐见，珠缀共玲珑。\n雷雨生成早，樵苏禁令雄。\n野藤高助绿，仙果迥呈红。\n惆怅缭垣暮，兹山闻暗蛩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14987.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14987","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}